{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_registerscriptmetadata", "label": "registerScriptMetadata registry", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A plain-JS WeakMap keyed by constructor replaced the stage-3 @Expose decorator: no shared Symbol between writer and reader, no leak when a class is unloaded, and inheritance is merged at read time (child overrides parent per field) so a base class is never polluted."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_scriptmetadata_builders", "label": "ScriptMetadata.field() / .entity() builders", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Namespaced by declaration merging (interface + const of the same name, no `namespace` keyword), in the same spirit as button()/vector2() on the input side; they always set the discriminant."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_exposefieldmetadata", "label": "ExposeFieldMetadata discriminated union", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stores only what the runtime needs (discriminant + required?) and stays open to extension so the compiler/editor can add kind/assetKind/runtimeType/tooltip later \u2014 no speculative editor schema is frozen now."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_gameentity", "label": "GameEntity handle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Transposes Unity's GameObject reference: wraps (world, entity, resolver) statelessly, caching no component data and re-resolving each call, so a destroyed entity yields undefined rather than dangling data."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_scriptresolver", "label": "ScriptResolver interface", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GameEntity lives in scripting/core and depends on this interface rather than the concrete runtime ScriptManager, preserving the runtime \u2192 core dependency direction and avoiding a cycle."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_attachprops", "label": "AttachProps mapped type", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lets a field be typed GameEntity inside the script but passed as a raw Entity at the attach call site; works because GameEntity is a method-rich interface no plain value matches, and Entity (number & brand) does not match GameEntity."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_injectprops", "label": "injectProps \u2014 warn, never throw", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only exposed fields are assigned; a missing required field or an unexposed key warns but never throws so the game does not break. Injection happens after construction and before onCreate, so scripts can read injected fields in onCreate."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_atlasscript_props", "label": "AtlasScript<TProps> phantom typing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A declared-but-never-assigned __props field carries TProps purely for inference; the {} default keeps every existing prop-less script compiling unchanged."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_gpu_boundary_insight", "label": "The GPU boundary is correct, not a limitation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A script must never build a texture/sprite/animation \u2014 exactly Unity's model where you receive a reference via [SerializeField] instead of calling new Texture(). Composition root fabricates, game logic consumes; all four listed frictions share this single root cause."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_babel_removal", "label": "Babel / decorator toolchain removal", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "@Expose required Babel in vitest and in every app plus a fragile top-level Symbol.metadata polyfill and clone-on-own-write inheritance handling; replacing it with an explicit registry removed the whole chain."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_props_metadata_desync", "label": "TProps \u2194 metadata desync caveat", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every injectable field is declared twice \u2014 in the AtlasScript<{...}> generic and in registerScriptMetadata \u2014 with no automatic link, so a field renamed on one side stays silently undefined. Inherent until the custom compiler generates both."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_import_type_gameentity", "label": "GameEntity must be import type", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A value import passes tsc --noEmit (erased at type-check) but breaks at runtime under Vite/esbuild with 'does not provide an export named GameEntity' \u2192 black screen; must be verified in the browser, not just by tsc."}, {"id": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_oncreate_ordering_caveat", "label": "getScript before onCreate caveat", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "getScript returns an instance as soon as it is registered, possibly before its onCreate ran; within one flush attach order equals flushCreates order, so read other scripts' state in onUpdate rather than onCreate."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_registerscriptmetadata", "target": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_scriptmetadata_builders", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_scriptmetadata_builders", "target": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_exposefieldmetadata", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_registerscriptmetadata", "target": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_exposefieldmetadata", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_injectprops", "target": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_registerscriptmetadata", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_injectprops", "target": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_gameentity", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_gameentity", "target": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_scriptresolver", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_attachprops", "target": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_gameentity", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_attachprops", "target": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_atlasscript_props", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_gpu_boundary_insight", "target": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_registerscriptmetadata", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/gameplay/exposed-script-variables.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_variables_babel_removal", "target": "docs_gameplay_exposed_script_